No, no, no, no, but that is something you can do in Star Fox 64.

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:35.260
So maybe, you know, that's a kudos for Star Fox 64.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.380
They have brakes. Well, technology was more advanced by then.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.760
And actually that game takes place in the past.

