00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:08.260
It's like, okay, you know, just slow, you know, point the aircraft up to slow down a little bit and then bring it down to get the altitude right.

00:27:08.440 --> 00:27:18.660
It didn't feel like it was asking a lot of the player, and I don't know if this is what you meant to say, Sean, but, yeah, this was the boss fight in the first game was the landing sequence.

00:27:18.660 --> 00:27:27.640
And now they've replaced that with this on-rails boss fight where it shoots at you and you shoot at it and you just kind of hope that you take it down before it takes you down.

00:27:27.640 --> 00:27:45.600
I guess my point was more so, like, if you're going to dumb down something that was probably complained about, that being the landing sequences, you're just going to dumb it down to just, like, follow the instructions on the screen, then maybe just remove it.

00:27:46.060 --> 00:27:48.440
Because right now it's kind of dumb.

00:27:49.080 --> 00:27:50.660
But, yeah, the new boss...

00:27:50.660 --> 00:27:51.800
See, it didn't bother me as much, though.

