Obviously, I wasn't a huge fan of that first version either where it was, like, really difficult to get on there.

00:28:02.540 --> 00:28:04.080
But it's just...

00:28:04.080 --> 00:28:11.220
Now, as is, if I wasn't thinking about the existence of the first game, to me, this would just be, like, oh, it's a fun little immersion exercise.

